    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Located in one of Cork’s most sought-after and mature residential locations. This charming 3 bed semi-detached residence is only around the corner from one of Cork’s most renowned landmark locations The Lough. The property is in excellent condition throughout with good quality fixtures and fittings, only a short stroll to the City Centre and convenient to all local amenities i.e. shopping, schools, sporting facilities and public transport. This property should make an excellent home for the eventual purchasers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION COMPRISES;\r\n\r\nReception Hall 12’ x 6’;\r\nSolid wood floor.\r\n1 Power Point. 1 Radiator (Radiator Cover).\r\n\r\nLiving Room 13’6’ x 11’6’; \r\nGas & iron fireplace with oak surround.\r\nSolid wood flooring.\r\n2 Power Points. 1 Window. 1 Light. 1 Radiator.\r\n\r\nFamily/Dining Room 12’ x 11’6’;\r\nSolid fuel stove.\r\nAttractive tile fireplace.\r\nLaminate flooring.\r\n2 Power Points. 1 Window. 1 Light. 1 Radiator.\r\n\r\nKitchen 9’ x 8’9’;\r\nModern shaker style built in kitchen.\r\nWall & floor units, cooker hood.\r\nPlumbed for washing machine.\r\nLaminate floor.\r\n8 Power Points. 1 Window. 1 Light. 1 Radiator (Radiator Cover).\r\n\r\nAttached Garage 15’6’ x 10’;\r\n1 Power Point. 1 Window. 1 Light. Roller Shutter Door.\r\n(Garage suitable for conversion).\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nLanding Area;\r\nLarge bright landing area.\r\n1 Window. 1 Light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 12’6’ x 12’;\r\nWith built in robes.\r\nCarpet.\r\n2 Power Points. 1 Window. 1 Light. 1 Radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 12’ x 12’;\r\nDouble built in robes.\r\nLaminate flooring.\r\n2 Power Points. 1 Window. 1 Light. 1 Radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 9’6’ x 8’; \r\nLaminate timber flooring\r\n2 Power Points. 1 Window. 1 Light. 1 Radiator.\r\n\r\nBathroom 7’2’ x 6’;\r\n3 piece white suite.\r\nShower unit.\r\nFully tiled walls & floors.\r\n1 Light. 1 Window. 1 Radiator.\r\n\r\nGarden;\r\nWalled in mature private garden to rear.\r\n\r\nOff street parking within enclosed garden to front elevation.\r\n\r\nBER; E\r\nBER NUMBER; 117858159\r\n\r\nGUIDE PRICE €475,000\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: - Note the above particulars are confidential and are given on the strict understanding that all negotiations shall be conducted through this firm.  Every care has been taken in their preparation, but we do not hold ourselves responsible for any inaccuracies.  All reasonable offers will be submitted to the owners for consideration"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "All main services are at hand\r\nOil fired central heating\r\nNatural Gas also connected to the property\r\nPVC double glazed windows\r\nConvenient to all local amenities\r\nClose to the Lough"
      },
